            "sid": "HOS 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yĩla Evalaimu waneenie, kwaĩ kũtetema; eenenevya mwene nthĩnĩ wa Isilaeli; ĩndĩ yĩla wavĩtisye maũndũnĩ ma Mbaali, nĩwakwie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yu nĩmekaa naĩ mbee na mbee, na meeseũvĩsye mĩvw’anano ya vetha woo matwekethetye, o mĩvw’anano kwĩanana na ũmanyi woo ene, yonthe wĩa wa ndũĩka: maneenaa ũndũ wayo, Andũ ala mathembaa nĩmamumunye tũsaũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
