          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu makeethĩwa ta ĩthweo ya kĩoko, na ta ĩmwe yĩla yĩtw’ĩkaa tene, ta wewa ũla ũtwaawa nĩ kĩlingi kuma kĩvũĩonĩ, na ta syũki yĩla yumaa mũtotenĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
